                      "width": "70%",
                      "cover": "on"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "body_html": "<div class=\"txt-role-text14\"><p>Renew and recover with exclusive access to a state-of-the-art <a href=\"https://www.tbpfit.com/\" class=\"links\">FIT Health Club</a> with full-service locker rooms in a spa-like atmosphere. <br></p></div>",
